{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-378f9d2c3a56","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-378f9d2c3a56","name":"柠檬水","category":"drink","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/drink/%E6%9F%A0%E6%AA%AC%E6%B0%B4/%E6%9F%A0%E6%AA%AC%E6%B0%B4.md","blob_sha":"412d8a13c8e420c79ea41fec8d8dc6f4248d2633","details":{"introduction":"这道饮品以新鲜柠檬为主角，搭配果蜜调和，酸甜平衡，冰镇后更感清凉解暑。柠檬富含维生素 C，经常饮用有助于补充营养、提神美白。制作步骤极简，只需捶打、加料、摇晃，新手也能在三五分钟内完成。","difficulty":"★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 原料\n  - 柠檬\n  - 果蜜\n  - 冰（可选）\n- 工具\n  - 雪克杯"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"一杯分量，约 500 毫升\n\n- 柠檬 40~45 克\n- 果蜜 40~45 克\n- 冰几块（可选）"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 称 40~45 克柠檬，放入雪克杯中\n2. 雪克杯盖盖子锤大约 10 次\n3. 加入果蜜 40~45 克\n4. 补水\n5. 摇晃均匀\n6. 最后根据喜好加冰"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 参考资料：[柠檬水教程](https://v.douyin.com/TVNTcXDi46I)"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：饮用水1000g、柠檬汁30g；整份约1030g。无糖版本，直接柠檬汁而非整果浸泡后丢弃。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":0.640777,"protein_g":0.010194,"carbohydrate_g":0.200971,"fat_g":0.00699},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients","version":"5763389a1b2b433f","fdc_ids":[173647,167747]},"profile_id":"family-378f9d2c3a56-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-378f9d2c3a56","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-378f9d2c3a56","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mix","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-378f9d2c3a56-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"water","grams":1000},{"key":"lemon_juice","grams":30}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"5763389a1b